{"id":"1fb5d562800bf588","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-propositional-semantic-substitution.md","title":"同时代入与布尔求值","display":"lem-propositional-semantic-substitution — 同时代入与布尔求值","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-propositional-semantic-substitution","aliases":["72-lem-propositional-semantic-substitution"],"display":"lem-propositional-semantic-substitution — 同时代入与布尔求值","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I Definition1.1.1, print5/PDF17; local structural proof","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","revision_2026_10_22":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-propositional-semantic-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-propositional-semantic-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-propositional-semantic-substitution — 同时代入与布尔求值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I Definition1.1.1, print5/PDF17; local structural proof"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fml},\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma,\\mathsf{Taut}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fml},\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma,\\mathsf{Taut}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathsf{Asn}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span> 为该语法的有限变量集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_\\sigma\">\\(a_\\sigma\\)</span> 在下式中构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\na_\\sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle p,⟦\\sigma(p)⟧_a\\rangle:p\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\},\\\\\na_\\sigma&amp;\\in\\mathsf{Asn},\\qquad⟦\\widehat\\sigma(A)⟧_a=⟦ A⟧_{a_\\sigma},\\\\\na\\restriction\\operatorname{Var}(A)=b\\restriction\\operatorname{Var}(A)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ ⟦ A⟧_a=⟦ A⟧_b,\\\\\nA\\in\\mathsf{Taut}&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\widehat\\sigma(A)\\in\\mathsf{Taut}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\na_\\sigma&amp;:=\\{\\langle p,⟦\\sigma(p)⟧_a\\rangle:p\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\},\\\\\na_\\sigma&amp;\\in\\mathsf{Asn},\\qquad⟦\\widehat\\sigma(A)⟧_a=⟦ A⟧_{a_\\sigma},\\\\\na\\restriction\\operatorname{Var}(A)=b\\restriction\\operatorname{Var}(A)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ ⟦ A⟧_a=⟦ A⟧_b,\\\\\nA\\in\\mathsf{Taut}&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\widehat\\sigma(A)\\in\\mathsf{Taut}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个代入公式有唯一布尔值，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_\\sigma\">\\(a_\\sigma\\)</span> 是总赋值。按公式树归纳，变量情形是其定义；常元与所有联结词由各自真值函数保持等式，得到第一项求值恒等式。同样的归纳给变量局部性。重言式在所有赋值、特别是在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_\\sigma\">\\(a_\\sigma\\)</span> 下为真，故同时代入保重言式。这里不能把第一次替换后的结果再顺次替换其他变量当作同时代入。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{Fml},\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma,\\mathsf{Taut}$ 取 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]；$A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}$、$\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}$、$a,b\\in\\mathsf{Asn}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fml},\\mathsf{PV},\\mathsf{Asn},\\mathsf{Sub},\\widehat\\sigma,\\mathsf{Taut}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathsf{Asn}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"a_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\na_\\sigma&:=\\{\\langle p,⟦\\sigma(p)⟧_a\\rangle:p\\in\\mathsf{PV}\\},\\\\\na_\\sigma&\\in\\mathsf{Asn},\\qquad⟦\\widehat\\sigma(A)⟧_a=⟦ A⟧_{a_\\sigma},\\\\\na\\restriction\\operatorname{Var}(A)=b\\restriction\\operatorname{Var}(A)&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ ⟦ A⟧_a=⟦ A⟧_b,\\\\\nA\\in\\mathsf{Taut}&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\widehat\\sigma(A)\\in\\mathsf{Taut}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"a_\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"a_\\sigma","display":false}],"bytes":2009,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-208","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-propositional-semantic-substitution|lem-propositional-semantic-substitution — 同时代入与布尔求值]]"}],"outgoing":["d6da6d3f3489ef90"]}